---
// GameLoopSection.astro - Section 11: The Complete Quantum Gameplay Loop
---

<section class="landing-section gameloop-section" id="sectionGameLoop">
  <div class="section-header-block">
    <div class="section-tag">
      <span class="tag-number">06</span>
      <span class="tag-label">SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="section-main-heading">
      THE <span class="text-cyan-glow">EXPERIMENT</span>.
    </h2>
    <p class="section-sub-heading">
      A continuous coupled loop between physical 2D navigation and Qiskit quantum statevector evolution.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Vertical Animated Quantum Pipeline -->
  <div class="pipeline-container glass-panel">
    <div class="pipeline-flow-track">
      <svg class="pipeline-svg-line" viewBox="0 0 4 600" preserveAspectRatio="none">
        <line x1="2" y1="0" x2="2" y2="600" id="circuitPathLine" stroke="url(#cyanLineGrad)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="1000" stroke-dashoffset="0" />
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="cyanLineGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#00f0ff" />
            <stop offset="50%" stop-color="#00f59b" />
            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#c77dff" />
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
      </svg>

      <!-- 8-Stage Steps -->
      <div class="pipeline-steps-list">
        <div class="pipeline-step-item circuit-step-badge">
          <span class="step-num">01</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4 class="step-name">VALID MOVEMENT</h4>
            <p class="step-desc">Player inputs step into an unblocked adjacent tile.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pipeline-step-item circuit-step-badge">
          <span class="step-num">02</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4 class="step-name">TOPOLOGY DISSOLVES</h4>
            <p class="step-desc">Exact 42 walls randomize while preserving spatial anchors and BFS solvability.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pipeline-step-item circuit-step-badge">
          <span class="step-num">03</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4 class="step-name">CIRCUIT ROTATION</h4>
            <p class="step-desc">Physical coordinates rotate unitary RY(θ) parameters in Qiskit.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pipeline-step-item circuit-step-badge">
          <span class="step-num">04</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4 class="step-name">CHECKPOINT SECURED</h4>
            <p class="step-desc">Player reaches checkpoint beacon, unlocking operator terminals.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pipeline-step-item circuit-step-badge">
          <span class="step-num">05</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4 class="step-name">GATE INTERACTION</h4>
            <p class="step-desc">Execute H, X, Z, or CNOT gates to manipulate the statevector.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pipeline-step-item circuit-step-badge">
          <span class="step-num">06</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4 class="step-name">WAVE MEASUREMENT</h4>
            <p class="step-desc">Perform Born-rule measurement to collapse specific barrier qubits.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pipeline-step-item circuit-step-badge">
          <span class="step-num">07</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4 class="step-name">PROBABILITY CONVERGENCE</h4>
            <p class="step-desc">Exit probability amplitude satisfies level threshold (>= 70%, 80%, 90%).</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pipeline-step-item circuit-step-badge">
          <span class="step-num">08</span>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4 class="step-name">CONTAINMENT ESCAPE</h4>
            <p class="step-desc">Player steps on Exit Portal and secures victory with quantum efficiency score.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .gameloop-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 120px 24px;
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .pipeline-container {
    padding: 48px 36px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }

  .pipeline-flow-track {
    position: relative;
  }

  .pipeline-svg-line {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    left: 20px;
    width: 4px;
    height: calc(100% - 48px);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .pipeline-steps-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .pipeline-step-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 14px 20px;
    background: rgba(10, 16, 26, 0.7);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border-radius: 8px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .pipeline-step-item:hover {
    border-color: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4);
    background: rgba(10, 16, 26, 0.95);
    transform: translateX(6px);
  }

  .step-num {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid var(--quantum-cyan);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--quantum-cyan);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .step-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .step-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: #f1f5f9;
  }

  .step-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .pipeline-container {
      padding: 24px 16px;
    }
    .pipeline-step-item {
      gap: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>
